WEBVTT

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.190
You're tuned in to Radio Fresh Venus Station!

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:16.770
Today's guest is Sunny Peace!

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:21.520
We're Sunny Peace and we just made our debut
the other day from Hoshimi Productions.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.600
Thank you for having us.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.230
Sunny Peace, what a nice name.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.060
What's its origin?

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:32.020
We made our debut together with Moon Tempest,
another group from our agency.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:36.150
So we came up with it together based
on the "sun and moon" concept.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.440
You came up with it yourselves?

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.730
Yes!

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:40.980
Wow!

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:44.520
As soon as both groups entered
the Venus Program,

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.190
they have both won
every concert battle so far.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:48.520
That's amazing!

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:51.850
You're stirring things up among
the industry folks, you know?

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:54.690
We have a concert battle after this, too.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.600
According to the information I have here,

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.100
your next opponent seems like a tough one,
how's your confidence level?

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.230
Confidence...?

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:04.270
Well...

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:05.150
Of course.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:07.230
We'll be fighting to win.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:09.480
Please come see us!

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:46.690
Now! Rokochan verses up-and-coming
rising star, Sunny Peace!

