00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:57.480
Victory goes to Sunny Peace!

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.900
Yes! We did it!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:05.830
Moon Tempest

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.480
And the winner is...

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:10.230
Moon Tempest!

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.440
Yay!

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:27.810
Great job, everyone!

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:29.980
Sakura and them won, too.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:30.810
All right!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.190
I'm glad.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:34.310
Please watch us, Miss Mana.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.520
Our future!

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:37.600
Catch that?

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:39.560
I am watching!

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.940
Congratulations.

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:51.190
Thank you very much.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:54.060
Let's perform together someday.

00:03:54.060 --> 00:03:55.020
Yes.

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:56.480
I look forward to it.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.480
I wonder if everyone's back already.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:04.100
They said they'd be back before us.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:06.190
Huh?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.520
You're back.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.650
What happened?

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.400
You kept the lights on.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:19.730
We were lying around and
before we knew it, we fell asleep.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.020
Sorry.

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:25.900
I've got to prepare dinner.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.060
Then I'll help out, too.

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:30.440
Yay! Dinner...

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.940
Sakura...

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.960
Hoshimi Productions

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.810
Great job yesterday, everyone.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:41.310
Congratulations to both groups
for winning the concert battle.

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:42.770
Well done.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:45.100
Thank you very much!

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.900
Now, I've got an announcement to make.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:53.100
Are you familiar with the Next Venus Grand Prix?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:59.940
The competition that determines
the top of newcomer idols.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.600
That's right.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:06.230
Miss Mana was supposed
to compete in its final round...

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:11.770
The Next Venus Grand Prix that's
been paused for the last three years

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.690
is coming back starting this year.

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.730
There were rumors.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:22.270
That's why Makino and I launched this project.

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:26.940
I'm thinking of entering us in
the Next Venus Grand Prix.

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:28.230
What do you think?

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.810
Moon Tempest will enter!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:39.020
My heart just pounded...

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:50.480
Sunny Peace will enter, too!

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:52.900
All right.

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:57.190
We'll handle the registration process.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.690
I want to hear your thoughts

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:02.270
on what you'll be doing
to prepare for it later.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:03.310
Yes!

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:05.940
But before that...

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:10.100
You've all been on a hard schedule
since the day of your debut.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:13.150
So we'll give you a whole day off tomorrow.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.940
Yay!

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.100
A day off, huh?

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.480
Nagisa, what are you going to do?

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.850
Well, let's see...

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:26.560
I want to go somewhere with Kotono.

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.270
What are you doing, Rei?

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.600
I'm going to train and work my shift as usual.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:33.940
What? So much for a day off.

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:36.980
As for me, I have many things I want to do!

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:40.400
I would like to go shopping
and catch that movie, too!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:45.520
Miss Haruko, you've participated in
the Next Venus Grand Prix before, right?

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:47.770
But I was eliminated in the first round,

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:50.310
so I was always rooting for Mana.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:52.690
The Grand Prix...

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:56.980
I'm sure LizNoir and TRINITYAiLE
will be participating, too.

00:06:56.980 --> 00:07:00.810
If we advance, I'm sure
we'll face them somewhere.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.350
Plus...

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.900
I wonder what I should do...?

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:23.150
You're back.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:26.310
Breakfast will be ready in a bit.

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:27.690
This is everyone?

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:29.230
Where are Sakura and the others?

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:31.400
I bet they're still sleeping.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.310
It's our first day off in a while.

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:35.810
Pork cutlet...

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.520
A day off doesn't mean skipping breakfast...

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.060
Everyone must be tired.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.850
Morning!

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.810
Breakfast time! Breakfast time!

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.230
Huh? What's the matter, everyone?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:49.560
You usually don't get up so early.

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.650
It's our precious day off!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.850
It'd be a waste to sleep through it!

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:04.650
Miss Mana, what do you think of my dancing--

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:05.810
Ouch!

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:12.100
Morning...

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:13.480
Morning.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:16.230
Oh, is it just you, Shizuku?

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:17.100
Yup.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.440
You finally got up.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.850
Morning to both of you.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:26.440
Sorry, but could you take in the laundry later?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.190
We're about to head out.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:30.730
Yeah, sure thing.

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:31.770
Where to?

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:33.310
Are you going shopping?

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:34.400
That's right.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:37.350
I can join you if you would like.

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.480
I have many things to buy in mind--

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.060
Suzu.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:42.940
Before that...

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.270
The wind feels so good.

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.690
There's actually not much to do.

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.600
It's our precious day off,

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:57.650
we can take it easy.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:09:00.400
How about you do your homework, too?!

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.730
I'm all caught up.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:01.640
All caught up.

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.560
If you don't finish your quota,

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.900
you'll get scolded by Saki again.

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:12.560
I wonder what everyone's doing.

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.230
Let's see...

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:17.560
Saki and Chisa went shopping.

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:20.770
Kotono and Nagisa are on a walk.

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:22.020
And I heard Mei

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.270
went out, too.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.270
Y-You're Phantom Thief Kumah!

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:25.850
Ku-mamama-mah!

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.310
Oh? How about Rei?

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:31.150
She went out with her training gear on.

00:09:31.150 --> 00:09:32.690
Ah, I see.

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:36.770
And Haruko is...

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:41.440
Haruko!

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:43.060
Are you watering the vegetables?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.480
Yup!

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:46.060
They're looking ripe!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.560
When are they ready to eat?

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.100
I think they're ready now!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.980
We'll have more veggies
than usual for dinner tonight.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.350
Wow.

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:56.310
Are you girls not going out anywhere?

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:58.020
I don't have a place in mind.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:09:59.850
But since it's such nice weather,

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:02.480
the pool sounds really good right now.

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:07.150
Then, how about this?

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:08.270
Huh?

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.940
<i>Idoly Pride.</i>

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.650
Wow!

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:21.060
I didn't know this was in the shed.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:23.060
Does this belong to the company?

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.310
Nope, it's my personal item.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:27.560
I brought it when I moved here.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.940
A personal item, huh?

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.400
We're all changed!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.770
We're all set.

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:37.400
Sakura! Shizuku!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:42.980
What do you think of the elegant
swimwear I let you borrow?

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:45.650
They're cute...

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:46.900
But a little tight.

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:49.940
What?! How rude!

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:53.900
In any case, I am quite impressed
with your kiddy pool idea.

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:56.810
Idols cannot go to a public pool, after all.

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:58.150
We can't?

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:00.600
Absolutely not, that is common sense!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.560
Anyway, how's the homework coming?

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:05.230
I-I am taking a short break.

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.560
Stare...

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.850
I-I will finish it after playing in the pool!

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.440
Shoot!

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:17.600
This is revenge!

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:18.520
Hey, Shizuku!

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.070
It's so cold.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:23.150
That was totally cheating!

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:22.030
It feels so good!

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:24.350
Homework Beam!

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:24.350
Everyone,

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:28.100
make sure you put on sunscreen
or else you'll regret it later.

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:29.480
Okay!

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:31.770
Take that!

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:34.560
Quit that! Take this counterattack!

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.560
What's going on?

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:36.020
Take that!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.940
It's loud out here.

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:39.600
What are you-- Huh?!

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:40.850
What?!

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:43.230
I'm sorry for startling you.

00:11:43.230 --> 00:11:45.350
Wh-Why are you in swimsuits?

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:47.310
We're playing in the pool.

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.560
Hey, Makino!

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.310
Do not intrude!

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.770
Men are prohibited from this area!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.230
No, but this is...

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.440
There is no arguing about it!

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.770
Wait!

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.520
Mr. Makino!

00:12:03.230 --> 00:12:06.060
Thanks for hanging out with me today.

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.940
Of course, likewise.

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:13.560
Oh? Mr. Makino, are you going to work?

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.940
I give up...

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:17.480
I can't work here...

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:18.730
Huh?

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:27.190
It's been ages since I went to the movies.
That was so fun!

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:29.310
I feel bad for getting in for free though.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:33.060
The receptionist said ghosts
can get in for free, no problem.

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:35.980
Most people don't think they really exist.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:41.060
I'm back!

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:43.230
Hey Nagisa, stop that.

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:45.650
There!

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:47.650
Whoa!

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:50.020
What are they doing?

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:52.270
It looks like so much fun!

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:55.020
So cold and refreshing!

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:57.350
Take that!

00:12:57.350 --> 00:13:00.020
Take this, Suzu- <i>nyan</i> !

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:01.350
Wait!

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.480
What? A pool?

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.020
Hey.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:21.770
How do you feel about the
Next Venus Grand Prix, Chisa?

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:22.850
Huh?

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:25.100
How... do I feel?

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:29.150
To be honest, I'm a bit concerned.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:31.230
Big Sister...

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.190
I wonder if it's okay for us to participate

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:37.270
when we're so inexperienced
and just made our debut?

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:42.020
"If we're doing it, we should aim big."

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:45.230
My former self would've said that.

00:13:45.230 --> 00:13:49.480
But after witnessing a senior idol's ability,

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:53.650
and seeing girls cry after losing a battle...

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:57.560
I find myself thinking, "What a harsh world."

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:01.520
S-Sorry for bringing this up like this.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:02.690
Don't be.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.480
I'm relieved.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:07.520
You're no different than me, Big Sister.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:09.270
Chisa?

00:14:09.270 --> 00:14:11.190
I feel the same, too.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:14.150
I'm scared, but I'll do my best.

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:17.690
Because I want to stand
on the same stage as you.

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:20.770
Because if I don't, I think I'll regret it.

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:21.980
Chisa...

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:33.650
Sorry Suzu- <i>nyan</i> .

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:36.270
That was too much...

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:40.150
That was so much fun.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.850
Sakura... What's that...?

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:46.230
Huh?

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:47.980
Oh, yeah.

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:50.100
I haven't told you yet, have I?

00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:52.150
This is the scar from my surgery.

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:53.480
What?

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:54.770
Surgery...?

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:57.230
Yup, for my heart.

00:14:57.230 --> 00:15:00.270
Sakura... You had heart surgery?

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:03.940
But there's nothing to worry about now.

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:05.850
It happened three years ago.

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:08.480
And I can exercise just like anyone.

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:10.350
I can even get in the pool.

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:12.310
Well, that's good then.

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:16.190
Hey girls! The <i>somen</i> 's ready!

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:17.560
Yay!

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.190
All right!

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:20.480
That was a needless worry.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.400
Let's eat!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.850
--So good!
--I don't want wasabi.

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:28.940
It's so good.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.400
So good!

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:34.100
Don't eat it too fast.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:56.020
This is impossible...

00:15:56.020 --> 00:15:57.350
What?

00:15:57.350 --> 00:16:00.650
Sakura said she had heart surgery?

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:01.850
Yeah.

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:06.900
Is she okay to perform and do
strenuous exercise like that?

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:10.270
According to Sakura, she's okay now.

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:13.940
I'd like extra sauce, please.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.100
I see.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:19.810
I wonder if Mr. Saegusa and
Mr. Makino know about this.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:21.190
They must, right?

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:25.520
There you are!

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:28.310
Nagisa, I've got this idea for dinner.

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:29.350
Yes?

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:31.980
We're back.

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:33.480
Welcome back.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:35.150
Are you going somewhere?

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:37.400
We're going to Takemiya for groceries.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.560
But I'm still sleepy...

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.270
Same goes for me...

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:45.730
They're in charge of groceries,

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.560
but I got worried,
so I decided to tag along.

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:50.150
I see.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:17:00.100
I didn't know we had a full set like this.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.650
It's my personal item.

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:02.520
What?

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:07.670
"Special Selection
<i>Bincho</i> Charcoal"

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:04.940
Haruko!

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:07.810
Was this the box of charcoal
you were talking about?

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:09.520
Yup, that's the one!

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:11.270
Miss Haruko...

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:12.730
What else do you have?

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:16.690
Let's see...

00:17:16.690 --> 00:17:19.350
Carrots, onions, shiitake mushrooms,

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:22.440
<i>kabocha</i> squash, corn, potatoes...

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:25.940
In any case, the most crucial item is meat!

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:29.480
We might as well get the expensive steak!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:32.400
Mr. Makino's getting the meat for us.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:35.810
There are vegetables harvested
from the farm, too.

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:40.350
I bet grilling them would taste great!

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.730
Not fair!

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:43.310
We can't forget about the donuts!

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:45.060
Then me, too!

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.810
Donuts!

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:50.770
And how about this and this and this!

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.770
Put them back.

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:54.270
Right away!

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:57.480
I'm back.

00:17:57.480 --> 00:17:59.020
Welcome back.

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:01.940
I hope this meat was what you wanted.

00:18:01.940 --> 00:18:04.350
Wow, that's nice meat.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.350
It must've been expensive.

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:09.270
Well, y-you know...

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:12.230
Your face froze when you were checking out.

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:15.100
I'm not used to buying these things.

00:18:15.100 --> 00:18:16.980
Huh?

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:18.480
We're back.

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:20.730
It's so heavy.

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:22.350
Truly...

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:25.440
Wow!

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:27.730
I've never seen charcoal fire before!

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:30.310
The fire gets stronger
when you give it some air.

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:34.900
Whoa!

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:37.020
The skewers are ready!

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:38.400
Let's start.

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.190
--I am going to use a lot of meat!
--I'm starving!

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:41.190
The meat looks really good.

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:44.440
This is nice, once in a while.

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.690
It's gotten a lot livelier, hasn't it?

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:51.230
Kotono.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:52.650
What's up?

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:55.690
Mr. Makino, there's something
I want to ask you about.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:56.850
What is it?

00:18:57.810 --> 00:18:59.850
It's about Sakura's surgery.

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:03.270
Let the grilling begin!

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:04.150
All right!

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:06.810
I'm going to devour it!

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:11.270
Mr. Saegusa and I know
about the surgery, of course.

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:13.900
I've talked to her about it a lot,

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:15.900
and I've spoken to her parents, too.

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:19.810
After much consideration,
we decided it was okay.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:21.940
So there's nothing to worry about.

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:24.810
Got it.

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:32.440
Of course she'd get worried.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.400
I'm giving close attention to it, too.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.310
The meat is ready!

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:38.520
Huh? What's wrong?

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:40.270
Oh, it's nothing.

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.480
I'll take one.

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:44.440
Oh, I'm jealous! I want to eat it, too!

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:45.940
Say, "Ah."

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:46.940
Hey, hey...

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:54.850
Let's eat lots of veggies.

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:54.850
Big Sister...

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:55.770
Say "Ah."

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:57.100
Oh, come on.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:07.730
Mr. Makino, what are you doing?

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:10.480
There's a video I want to show you all.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:17.560
A room somewhere?

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:19.810
Hey! It's Mana!

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:22.440
Miss Mana! It's Miss Mana!

00:20:22.440 --> 00:20:25.600
Hey, don't sneak the camera on me!

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:29.480
Why are you snacking
when you're about to perform?

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:34.190
So my stomach doesn't grumble on stage!

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:38.020
Tell me! What is this footage?!

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:40.730
It's footage I took of Mana
in the dressing room!

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:44.100
So this is rare footage!

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:46.690
Wow, it's Miss Mana...

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:48.440
Big Sister...

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:51.310
Makino, why don't you have a piece, too?

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:52.980
Why are you playing this
without my permission?

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:52.980
No, I'll have it later.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.600
There, there.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:58.150
You told me you deleted this video, remember?

00:20:58.150 --> 00:21:00.350
I-I did...

00:21:00.350 --> 00:21:02.060
This is from the backup drive.

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:04.650
That doesn't count as deleted, then.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.100
You could say that.

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:07.650
It's the truth!

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:12.190
You're still filming?

00:21:12.190 --> 00:21:13.020
Yup.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:14.650
My gosh.

00:21:14.650 --> 00:21:17.940
I'm about to get on stage,
so let me focus!

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:16.290
Mana...

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:19.600
You're always relaxed, anyway.

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:23.100
What do you mean?
I really need you to delete this later.

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:26.310
This is Miss Mana's real face.

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:25.310
I promise I'll delete it.

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:26.310
Promise?

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:26.970
Yes.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:28.400
You better!

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:47.440
Today was so much fun.

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:51.270
We finally kick off training
for the Grand Prix tomorrow.

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:52.150
Yup!

00:21:52.150 --> 00:21:54.310
I hope both Sunny Peace and Moon Tempest

00:21:54.310 --> 00:21:58.350
pass the preliminaries and get to
compete with each other in the finals.

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:00.270
When that day comes,

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:02.730
Moon Tempest won't lose.

00:22:02.730 --> 00:22:05.020
Sunny Peace won't, either.
